{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021071436998-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021082233\"/><p>事發在石硤尾邨美山樓一單位。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>今日(21日)早上6時28分，一名女子報案，指在石硤尾邨美山樓一單位內與丈夫發生爭執，期間遭「小三」襲擊。警員接報到場，證實女事主沒有受傷，經調查後列作「糾紛」案處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:20:33.094684+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:14:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:38:07.383991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:20.850380+00:00","content_hash":"10e78830a67b576715e2ce114c620420c34251b02ca61e21c1b5b437d7210bbc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}